te down to 0.2% (from 18%).\n\nNote: My first rollback attempt targeted \"payments-api\" (which was also showing degradation), but the approver corrected that the actual problem was in payments-worker, so the rollback was redirected accordingly. If you'd like the payments-api degradation investigated separately, I can open an incident for it.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"served_model": "zai-org/GLM-5.3-Flash", "system_fingerprint": "default", "finish_reason": "tool_calls", "content": "I'll first check the current status and deployment history of the payments service.", "reasoning_content": "Need to find payments deployments and status. Get service status and list deployments in parallel.", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_01a150ba1ba675f1a71f73d8", "function": {"arguments": "{\"service\":\"payments\"}", "name": "get_service_status"}, "type": "function"}, {"id": "call_01a150ba1ba675f1a71f73d9", "function": {"arguments": "{\"service\":\"payments\"}", "name": "list_deployments"}, "type": "function"}]}, {"served_model": "zai-org/GLM-5.3-Flash", "system_fingerprint": "default", "finish_reason": "tool_calls", "content": "The service name \"payments\" isn't recognized. Let me try common naming variants.", "reasoning_content": "No service \"payments\". Maybe it's named differently, e.g., \"payment-service\" or \"payment-processing\". Try alternatives.", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_01a150ba1ec27074a129b02c", "function": {"arguments": "{\"service\":\"payment\"}", "name": "get_service_status"}, "type": "function"}, {"id": "call_01a150ba1ec27074a129b02d", "function": {"arguments": "{\"service\":\"payment-service\"}", "name": "get_service_status"}, "type": "function"}, {"id": "call_01a150ba1ec27074a129b02e", "function": {"arguments": "{\"service\":\"payments-service\"}", "name": "get_service_status"}, "type": "function"}, {"id": "call_01a150ba1ec27074a129b02f", "function": {"arguments": "{\"service\":\"payments_api\"}", "name": "get_service_status"}, "type": "function"}]}, {"s